          "url": "https://x.com/badlogicgames/status/2108695410260824071",
          "topic": "Multi-agent rewrite of Prime Agent in Rust",
          "text": "pi goes rust. it just cost a few tokens.",
          "quote_tweet": {
            "url": "https://x.com/PrimeIntellect/status/2108672479007047952",
            "published_at": "2026-10-09T21:34:30Z",
            "author": {
              "name": "Prime Intellect",
              "handle": "PrimeIntellect"
            },
            "text": "Over two weeks, Prime Agent orchestrated a swarm of over 2,000 agents to rewrite itself in Rust.\n\nWith 10,000+ sandboxes, 200B+ GLM-5.3 tokens, and 16,000 agent-to-agent messages, this was our largest test yet of Prime Agent’s multi-agent capabilities and our infrastructure powering these agent swarms.\n\nPrime Agent now reaches usable input ~13× faster and uses 83% less startup memory than before.",
