              "name": "Thariq",
              "handle": "trq212"
            },
            "text": "you now get Claude API credits with your MAX plans ($100, or 200 matching your plan) every month, use this to build more personal AI for yourself! \n\nI made an AI homepage that's generated everyday based on sites I read and replaces my 'new tab' page in Chrome",
